# (`max_cached_input_tokens`). The counter still moves and is still persisted, so every
# display looks right, but a run can read unbounded cached input without ever ending: the
# bucket exists and its limit does not.
#
# Flips the cached-ceiling test.
# APP: samen_core
# TEST_FILES: test/ai/agent_durability_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: #74 RED: exceeding the CACHED ceiling ends the run with its own bounded kind
diff --git a/samen_core/lib/samen/ai/agent.ex b/samen_core/lib/samen/ai/agent.ex
